{"id":"3995506569337490615","query":"演唱會","source_queries":["演唱會"],"text":"最近荷包失血嚴重\n出售複數週邊回血\n\n11週年演唱會大人中週邊商品\n整套不拆售，有2套(圖1) 1套NT$2,400\n包含以下商品：\n1.紀念T-shirt (圖2，尺寸是XL)\n2.運動毛巾 (圖3)\n3.斜背包 (圖4)\n4.貼紙組 (圖5)\n5.珐瑯杯 (圖6、7)\n6.襪子1雙 (圖8)\n怕珐瑯杯可能在運輸途中碎掉，整套只能面交\n面交地點臺南舊市區均可\n10月3日可在臺北101附近面交\n珐瑯杯(2個，1個NT$480)跟貼紙組(1組，NT$120)當初有多買，可單買\n但珐瑯杯只能面交，貼紙組可賣貨便\n\n11週年大人中演唱會 LIVE 2CD+BD Boxset (圖9)  NT$1,200\nCD跟BD都沒有用過\n只有拿出來給廣仲簽名而已\n可面交(地點同上)或賣貨便\n\n2020運動毛巾 (圖10) NT$350\n可面交(地點同上)或賣貨便\n\n*賣貨便取貨率低於95%不出貨\n\n另徵求原價收「盧廣仲2018春季世界巡迴年度限定毛巾(NT $380)」，廣仲的毛巾只差這條沒買到，蝦皮賣3、4千我買不下去","username":"windsfan2004rk","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@windsfan2004rk/post/Ddy5A5DGcy3","timestamp":"2026-09-27T15:05:21Z","media_type":"CAROUSEL_ALBUM","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["演唱會"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr"],"searched_at":"2026-09-27T17:23:53.174771717Z","first_seen_at":"2026-09-27T17:23:59.237357Z","last_seen_at":"2026-09-27T17:23:59.237357Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_25ea9ff745a3e583","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":false,"clean_exclusion_reason":"ticket_resale"}
{"id":"3995510341257860648","query":"演唱會","source_queries":["演唱會"],"text":"明天記者去問蔣萬安\n「關於沈伯洋去隨性演唱會有什麼看法？」\n\n蔣萬安：一個城市的進步，不應該只看演唱會經濟，而我們團隊都是戰戰兢兢，不會有隨性的行程安排，The young generation, they don't really have, you know 隨性……","username":"spo.onkid","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@spo.onkid/post/Ddy53x7ExYo","timestamp":"2026-09-27T15:12:50Z","media_type":"TEXT_POST","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["演唱會"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr"],"searched_at":"2026-09-27T17:23:53.174626715Z","first_seen_at":"2026-09-27T17:23:59.237357Z","last_seen_at":"2026-09-27T17:23:59.237357Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_1a0467a584bd9519","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
{"id":"3995521792747323773","query":"演唱會","source_queries":["演唱會"],"text":"我就知實有人會話清水叔走音\n但係佢哋真係年紀唔細\n無可能要求佢把聲同十幾年前一樣咁靚\n佢哋早幾年已經成日訪問話想嚟香港開演唱會\n等咗幾年終於今年真係嚟開\n我已經好感恩好開心同好滿足\n我差啲以為成世都無得喺香港睇back number㗎\n真誠真係好重要 佢哋啲歌大大話陪咗我十幾年\n就算走音 但你睇得出佢哋真係比足200%力去演出\n仲點好意思話佢哋🥹\n喺世界萬變嘅日子 可以睇騷時請好好珍惜\n機會唔係一定會有🙂‍↕️","username":"uluru852","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@uluru852/post/Ddy8ea9CUF9","timestamp":"2026-09-27T15:35:36Z","media_type":"TEXT_POST","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["演唱會"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr"],"searched_at":"2026-09-27T17:23:53.174673092Z","first_seen_at":"2026-09-27T17:23:59.237357Z","last_seen_at":"2026-09-27T17:23:59.237357Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_9c9386445296fa67","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
{"id":"3995527330109433641","query":"演唱會","source_queries":["演唱會"],"text":"隨性樂團《魔神仔》發片巡迴最終場\n\n一開始就遲到，MC短短，蛋糕一直抱怨中秋連假要賣票真的不容易，聽眾大多都要放假陪家人。但也因為這個檔期都沒什麼表演，反而讓這場演唱會來了許多嘉賓，GIGO、康婷文、鄭宇辰、SKARAOKE都來了，猶如中秋聯歡晚會一樣，唱的高興玩的開心！\n\n最後安可，特別把麥克風遞給台下的沈伯洋，一開始只是試著邀約，沒想到他真的來了，而且還拿著初代毛巾應援一整場。沈伯洋也沒多說什麼，簡單致意，也沒上台，他說他聽完一整場，有被療癒到的感覺，把舞台的光環留給專場的主人“隨性樂團”。\n\n難得看到主唱蛋糕這麼的感性，眼淚有如少女漫畫主角般的止不住，不哭不哭眼淚是珍珠，21年持續努力大家都能感受到，火球祭再次和大家聚首吧！","username":"paulwang7188","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@paulwang7188/post/Ddy9vABiacp","timestamp":"2026-09-27T15:46:36Z","media_type":"CAROUSEL_ALBUM","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["演唱會"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr"],"searched_at":"2026-09-27T17:23:53.174736641Z","first_seen_at":"2026-09-27T17:23:59.237357Z","last_seen_at":"2026-09-27T17:23:59.237357Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_46c578fc8e9e2c80","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
{"id":"3995535423513940471","query":"演唱會","source_queries":["演唱會"],"text":"除左個Show本身好睇之外\n想同Day 2 Zone A1近中間通道前排嘅手足講\n你地係咪有病㗎\n個個都勁Firm\n不分年齡 不分男女 個個嗌到聲沙 拍手拍到爛\n可能係我人生其中一場睇過最好氣氛嘅演唱會\n隔離個師兄一齊嗌足全場 完場仲專登搵我揸個手\n好有Feel\n\n多謝back number \n希望佢地會再嚟香港 香港嘅Fans好出色架！","username":"n0thing_spec1a1","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@n0thing_spec1a1/post/Ddy_kxmCdH3","timestamp":"2026-09-27T16:02:40Z","media_type":"IMAGE","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["演唱會"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr"],"searched_at":"2026-09-27T17:23:53.174498385Z","first_seen_at":"2026-09-27T17:23:59.237357Z","last_seen_at":"2026-09-27T17:23:59.237357Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_dd82e33eb95c563a","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
{"id":"3995536482458879029","query":"演唱會","source_queries":["演唱會"],"text":"太想見林于馨 於是鼓起勇氣來@jam\n想請問有經驗的前輩們 終演後特典會是什麼🤔 是可以見送的意思嗎～～\n特典會是買票就可以有的福利嗎～\n除了New chapter 演唱會\n第一次追TPE線下 \n生怕像9月一樣搶不到公演門票😖\n所以無論如何 10月一定要見一次林于馨！！！\n歡迎有經驗的各位前輩們 \n可以分享交流經驗談🙏🙏🙏","username":"minions___stuart","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@minions___stuart/post/Ddy_0L0E0Q1","timestamp":"2026-09-27T16:04:47Z","media_type":"TEXT_POST","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["演唱會"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr"],"searched_at":"2026-09-27T17:23:53.174646723Z","first_seen_at":"2026-09-27T17:23:59.237357Z","last_seen_at":"2026-09-27T17:23:59.237357Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_2bc03b3cd844b831","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
{"id":"3995541335511799967","query":"演唱會","source_queries":["演唱會"],"text":"雖然見到啲人話bn演唱會日翻打速成好搞笑\n但想講￼揀打字翻譯嘅話 係咪請個有返咁上下打字速度嘅會好少少\n做文書嗰啲工入職都有打字速度要求啦...\n\nJHGG雖然話打字翻譯背後係想貼心啲唔打斷台上嘅講嘢\n但係台上講完要慢慢等緊打字嗰位翻譯完成句😂￼\n已經冇咗好多時間￼\n請個打字都唔熟嘅￼咁不如口譯？","username":"kwtjang","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@kwtjang/post/DdzA6zkkhif","timestamp":"2026-09-27T16:14:25Z","media_type":"TEXT_POST","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["演唱會"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr"],"searched_at":"2026-09-27T17:23:53.174590186Z","first_seen_at":"2026-09-27T17:23:59.237357Z","last_seen_at":"2026-09-27T17:23:59.237357Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_d38da852f791a115","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
